OL,3,GNEWSA'Special' for dad as daughter
OL,4,Ajoins his university
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father says it will be "special" to
OL,7,Fhave his daughter follow in his
OL,8,Ffootsteps and go to the same university
OL,9,Fhas him.
OL,11,FPeter Healey will complete his
OL,12,Fparamedic science apprenticeship at the
OL,13,FUniversity of Wolverhampton in April
OL,14,F2027.
OL,16,FAhead of then, this September, his
OL,17,Fdaughter, Chloe, will begin studying
OL,18,Fforensic science at the university.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
